@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title C state — review-work overview\nMC-SM-RPT-0.1 · seven internal phases
hide empty description
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam legendFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowFontSize 22
skinparam titleFontSize 26
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #27465B
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam nodesep 20
state "QUEUED" as Q
state "INVOKING" as I
state "VALIDATING" as V
state "RECOVERY_WAIT" as R
state "ACCEPTED" as A
state "HISTORICAL" as H
state "CLOSED_WITHOUT_RESULT" as X
[*] --> Q : admit current bundle
Q --> I : start [G_START + bound]
I --> V : reply [G_EVENT]
I --> R : timeout [G_EVENT]
V --> R : invalid [G_EVENT]
R --> I : retry [G_EVENT + bound]
V --> A : valid [G_EVENT]\n/ store review + audit
R --> X : exhausted [G_EVENT]
Q --> X : retire [G_RETIRE]
I --> X : retire [G_RETIRE]
V --> X : retire [G_RETIRE]
R --> X : retire [G_RETIRE]
A --> H : retire [G_RETIRE]\n/ preserve result
H --> [*]
X --> [*]
legend bottom
<b>Domain owns every transition and atomic effect.</b>
G_START: selected queued work/round; no invocation yet.
G_EVENT: selected work/round/active invocation;
in recovery, selected failed/retired invocation.
G_RETIRE: compare the exact work/association retired.
Recheck current context + permission at start/accept.
Stale events cannot retire or alter replacement work.

ACCEPTED stores one immutable RiskReview; its outcome:
PASS | PASS_WITH_WARNING | REVISE |
NEEDS_INFORMATION | ESCALATE.
Those five results are NOT these seven phases.
New proposal → new work; same-proposal retry → new
selected invocation. Failure is not a sixth outcome.

Compact projection of member-c-state.puml (MC-SM-0.1).
Complete actions/bounds: docs/18 MC-D01-03 disposition.
No new wire fields; design only, not runtime evidence.
endlegend
@enduml
